WEBVTT

00:00:59.816 --> 00:01:01.210
unto ourselves.

00:01:01.596 --> 00:01:05.851
(Laughter)

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:09.935
The future states that there is no time

00:01:09.959 --> 00:01:13.261
other than the collapsation
of that sensation

00:01:13.285 --> 00:01:15.907
of the mirror of the memories
in which we are living.

00:01:15.931 --> 00:01:19.283
(Laughter)

00:01:19.307 --> 00:01:21.144
Common knowledge,

00:01:21.168 --> 00:01:22.684
but important nonetheless.

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:26.098
(Laughter)

00:01:26.122 --> 00:01:28.456
As we face fear in these times,

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.490
and fear is all around us,